'''Replica Kalisa's Grace''' is a pair of [[unique]] {{il|Samite Gloves}}. It is the [[replica]] version of {{il|Kalisa's Grace}}.

==Modifiers==
Applicable [[skill gem]]s socketed in this item are [[Support Skill Gems|support]]ed by level 18 {{il|Unleash Support}}. All support stats are accounted for, including the cost and reservation multiplier.

